  "abstract": "<p>See how Metsera, Certara, and Altasciences built an integrated MIDD partnership to advance GLP-1 programs from due diligence to Phase 2.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.certara.com/case-study/accelerating-glp-1-drug-development-how-metsera-certara-altasciences-reached-phase-2/\">Accelerating GLP-1 Drug Development: How Metsera, Certara &#038; Altasciences Reached Phase 2</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.certara.com\">Certara</a>.</p>",
