        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row top-level vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top  top_margin_80px bottom_margin_40px top_margin_phone_40px\" id=\"fws_6af646f7ae74e\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop using-bg-color\" style=\"background-color: #f1edec;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-8 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col tl_br_15px bl_br_15px left_padding_desktop_32px top_padding_desktop_32px right_padding_desktop_32px bottom_padding_desktop_32px \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-with-aniamtion-wrap \">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"hover-wrap\"> \n          <div class=\"hover-wrap-inner\">\n            <img alt=\"\" class=\"img-with-animation case-study-logo skip-lazy\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://www.certara.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/altasciences-partner.jpg\" width=\"600\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>As Metsera expanded its GLP-1 portfolio, the company faced increasing pressure to move quickly while balancing scientific complexity, compressed timelines, and growing stakeholder expectations.</p>\n<p>Execution of first-in-human (FIH) and early development studies must prioritize participant safety, and traditionally utilizes a cautious approach to decision making, which often moves slowly due to the numerous stakeholders and functions involved in preclinical development strategy and execution.</p>\n<p>Metsera needed a different approach: an integrated development partnership capable of accelerating programs from candidate evaluation through clinical proof of concept, while ensuring participant safety, reducing development risk and improving decision confidence along the way.</p>\n<p>That partnership brought together Certara and Altasciences.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-4 resources-link-list-corners wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col el_spacing_20px left_padding_desktop_32px top_padding_desktop_32px right_padding_desktop_32px bottom_padding_desktop_32px \" style=\"color: #fff7fa;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"column-image-bg-wrap column-bg-layer viewport-desktop\"><div class=\"inner-wrap\"><div class=\"column-image-bg\"></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b2c43\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading resource-label\" style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; line-height: 24px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Services</strong></div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/solutions/midd/\">Model-Informed Drug Development</a>, <a href=\"/services/drug-development-services/\">Drug Development Services</a>, <a href=\"/services/model-based-meta-analysis/\">Model-Based Meta-Analysis</a>, <a href=\"/services/quantitative-systems-pharmacology/\">Quantitative Systems Pharmacology</a>, <a href=\"/services/project-management/\">Project Management</a></p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b313e\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading resource-label\" style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; line-height: 24px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Solutions</strong></div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/solutions/discovery/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Discovery</a>, <a href=\"/solutions/preclinical/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Preclinical</a>, <a href=\"/solutions/early-clinical/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Early Clinical</a>, <a href=\"/solutions/strategic-leadership/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Strategic Leadership</a></p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b3464\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading resource-label\" style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ffffff; line-height: 24px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Therapeutic area</strong></div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>GLP-1 and metabolic disease</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section  top_margin_0px bottom_margin_40px\" id=\"Resources-Full-width-text-with-optional-button\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding padding-4-percent_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b382a\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">Building an integrated development partnership</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b3c4b\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Metsera initially engaged Certara for strategic due diligence and candidate evaluation support.</p>\n<p>As development accelerated, the collaboration expanded into a broader partnership spanning integrated drug development strategy, translational modeling, clinical pharmacology, biosimulation, dose optimization, and cross-functional program leadership.</p>\n<p>As programs progressed into IND-enabling and clinical development, Altasciences joined as the integrated clinical execution partner, providing:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Clinical trial execution</li>\n<li>Bioanalytical services</li>\n<li>Biostatistics</li>\n<li>Clinical operations</li>\n<li>Integrated Phase 1-2 delivery across the U.S. and Canada</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Altasciences&#8217; acceleration platform also enabled rapid clinical startup through Canada&#8217;s favorable early-phase regulatory environment, alongside real-time formulation and bioanalytical capabilities supporting accelerated Phase 1 development.</p>\n<p>Together, Certara and Altasciences established a uniquely integrated development model, combining strategic drug development expertise, advanced biosimulation, and coordinated clinical execution across preclinical, translational, and clinical development activities.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section  top_margin_0px bottom_margin_40px\" id=\"Resources-Full-width-text-with-optional-button\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding padding-4-percent_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b41cd\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">What made the partnership different</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b442a\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Unlike traditional development models, where strategy and operational execution occur separately, Certara and Altasciences operated as a unified extension of Metsera&#8217;s organization.</p>\n<p>The teams integrated scientific strategy, quantitative modeling, operational execution, and real-time data-informed decisions across the development lifecycle.</p>\n<p>This enabled:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Faster study startup through parallel preclinical and clinical planning, and integrated toxicology and clinical oversight</li>\n<li>Faster study execution, facilitated by real-time decision-making and continuous data visibility</li>\n<li>Faster reporting through coordinated PK analysis and CSR delivery</li>\n<li>Faster decision making through integrated MIDD frameworks that helped optimize study design and dosing strategies before costly downstream decisions were made</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Altasciences further streamlined execution through:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rapid assay development and validation</li>\n<li>Parallel regulatory preparation</li>\n<li>Shared GLP-1 study templates</li>\n<li>Seamless transition from preclinical to human-ready assays</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The result was faster execution without sacrificing participant safety, scientific rigor or data quality.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section  top_margin_0px bottom_margin_40px\" id=\"Resources-Full-width-text-with-optional-button\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding padding-4-percent_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b4768\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">MIDD in action</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b497c\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>A major differentiator of the collaboration was the way Model-Informed Drug Development (MIDD) principles were embedded throughout the program lifecycle.</p>\n<p>Rather than treating modeling as a standalone scientific activity, Certara integrated quantitative frameworks directly into strategic development decisions, using approaches including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PK/PD modeling</li>\n<li>PBPK and QSP modeling</li>\n<li>Model-based meta-analysis (MBMA)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Mechanistic virtual twin simulation</p>\n<p>Together, the teams evaluated critical translational questions related to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Weight loss</li>\n<li>Safety and tolerability</li>\n<li>Dose optimization</li>\n<li>Exposure-response relationships</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By applying multiple modeling approaches, the team improved confidence in development decisions while accelerating progression toward proof-of-concept milestones.</p>\n<p>The approach also aligned with growing regulatory support for model-informed development strategies and adaptive trial design frameworks.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section  top_margin_0px bottom_margin_40px\" id=\"Resources-Full-width-text-with-optional-button\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding padding-4-percent_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b4dcf\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">Accelerating development across multiple programs</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b5027\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>For one oral GLP-1 receptor agonist program, the partnership achieved approximately 15.5 months from toxicology initiation to topline clinical data, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>IND-enabling studies</li>\n<li>CTA approval</li>\n<li>SAD/MAD execution</li>\n<li>Topline safety and pharmacodynamic results</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For an injectable GLP-1 program, the teams achieved approximately 18.5 months from toxicology initiation to 4-week clinical topline data, while simultaneously advancing chronic toxicology studies in parallel.</p>\n<p>In a second injectable GLP-1 program, the collaboration enabled progression from First-in-Human initiation to Phase 2a 12-week readout in approximately nine months, through overlapping SAD/MAD cohorts, rapid dose escalation, coordinated safety oversight, and accelerated data analysis.</p>\n<p>Over approximately two years, the partnership expanded from support for a single compound into more than 30 integrated engagements spanning six additional oral and injectable GLP-1 assets.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-bottom testimonial-slider-bg right_padding_40px left_padding_40px top_padding_phone_10px bottom_padding_phone_10px right_padding_phone_10px left_padding_phone_10px\" id=\"Resources-Testimonial\" style=\"padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer using-image\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop using-image using-bg-color\" style=\"background-position: left top; background-color: #ffffff;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col left_padding_phone_4pct top_padding_desktop_4pct top_padding_phone_4pct right_padding_phone_4pct bottom_padding_desktop_0px bottom_padding_phone_4pct \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"column-bg-overlay-wrap column-bg-layer\"><div class=\"column-bg-overlay\" style=\"background-color: #212b3b;\"></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"testimonial_slider span_12 col font_size_desktop_21px font_line_height_28px disable-height-animation\"><div class=\"slides\"><blockquote>  <p><span class=\"open-quote\">&#8220;</span>I marvel at the nature and extent of what we accomplished together... all in the context of tough timelines and competition.<span class=\"close-quote\">&#8221;</span> <span class=\"bottom-arrow\"></span></p><span class=\"testimonial-name\"></span><span class=\"title\">Former SVP &amp; Head, Translational and Quantitative Clinical Pharmacology, Metsera</span></blockquote></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section  top_margin_0px bottom_margin_40px\" id=\"Resources-Full-width-text-with-optional-button\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding padding-4-percent_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b5b06\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">Why it matters</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b5d70\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>The Metsera collaboration demonstrated how integrating strategic drug development, advanced biosimulation, and coordinated clinical execution can help sponsors:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduce development risk</li>\n<li>Improve study design and decision-making</li>\n<li>Accelerate timelines to proof of concept</li>\n<li>Reduce operational friction</li>\n<li>Build confidence with investors and external stakeholders</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The collaboration also highlighted the value of integrating strategic development and execution expertise early in development, when the opportunity to influence timelines, study design, and overall program success is greatest.</p>\n<p>By combining Certara&#8217;s MIDD expertise with Altasciences&#8217; acceleration platform, the partnership created a scalable framework for faster, smarter early drug development.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row  top_margin_80px bottom_margin_120px\" id=\"Contact-us-CTA\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop using-bg-color\" style=\"background-color: #f1edec;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b60b0\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column tl_br_15px tr_br_15px bl_br_0px br_br_0px left_padding_desktop_54px left_padding_phone_24px top_padding_desktop_54px top_padding_phone_24px right_padding_desktop_54px right_padding_phone_24px bottom_padding_desktop_54px bottom_padding_phone_24px \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"column-image-bg-wrap column-bg-layer viewport-desktop\"><div class=\"inner-wrap\"><div class=\"column-image-bg\"></div></div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 38px; color: #ffffff; line-height: 44px; text-align: left;\">Accelerating medicines through integrated development</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex vc_row-o-content-top top_padding_phone_24px\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b64d1\" style=\"padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 60px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-6 contact-cta wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column left_padding_desktop_54px left_padding_phone_24px top_padding_phone_24px right_padding_desktop_100px right_padding_phone_24px bottom_padding_desktop_54px bottom_padding_phone_24px \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>The Certara + Altasciences partnership demonstrates how integrated development models, grounded in Model-Informed Drug Development, operational alignment, and shared accountability, can help biotech companies reduce risk, make smarter decisions earlier, and accelerate the path to proof of concept.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"divider-wrap\"><div class=\"divider\" style=\"height: 16px;\"></div></div>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column left_padding_desktop_24px right_padding_desktop_24px \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><br />\n</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section\" id=\"FAQs\" style=\"padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 80px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b6bcb\" style=\"padding-bottom: 40px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding force-desktop-text-align-left no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 38px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 44px; text-align: left;\">FAQs</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"toggles \"><div class=\"toggle extra-color-1\"><h3 class=\"toggle-title\"><a class=\"toggle-heading\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa fa-plus-circle\"></i>What is Model-Informed Drug Development (MIDD), and how was it used in this partnership?</a></h3><div><div class=\"inner-toggle-wrap\"><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b6fdc\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>MIDD embeds quantitative modeling directly into strategic development decisions, rather than treating it as a standalone activity run after the fact. Certara used MIDD to inform starting-dose justification, next-dose decisions between cohorts, and study design choices before they became costly downstream commitments.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"toggle extra-color-1\"><h3 class=\"toggle-title\"><a class=\"toggle-heading\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa fa-plus-circle\"></i>How long did it take to advance a GLP-1 program from toxicology initiation to clinical data?</a></h3><div><div class=\"inner-toggle-wrap\"><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b7279\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Timelines varied by program: approximately 15.5 months for an oral GLP-1 receptor agonist program, and approximately 18.5 months for an injectable GLP-1 program to reach 4-week data (extending to ~24.5 months for 12-week proof-of-concept data).</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"toggle extra-color-1\"><h3 class=\"toggle-title\"><a class=\"toggle-heading\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa fa-plus-circle\"></i>What did Certara and Altasciences each contribute to the partnership?</a></h3><div><div class=\"inner-toggle-wrap\"><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b755a\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Certara led strategic due diligence, translational modeling, biosimulation, and dose optimization. Altasciences served as the integrated clinical execution partner, delivering trial execution, bioanalytical services, and biostatistics across Phase 1–2 studies in the U.S. and Canada. Together, the two functioned as one coordinated team rather than sequential vendors.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"toggle extra-color-1\"><h3 class=\"toggle-title\"><a class=\"toggle-heading\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa fa-plus-circle\"></i>How many GLP-1 programs has this partnership supported?</a></h3><div><div class=\"inner-toggle-wrap\"><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b77f6\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>Over approximately two years, the partnership expanded from a single compound into more than 30 integrated engagements spanning six additional oral and injectable GLP-1 assets.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"toggle extra-color-1\"><h3 class=\"toggle-title\"><a class=\"toggle-heading\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa fa-plus-circle\"></i>Why does speed matter in GLP-1 drug development right now?</a></h3><div><div class=\"inner-toggle-wrap\"><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b7a4d\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>The GLP-1 and metabolic disease landscape is highly competitive, with multiple sponsors racing toward differentiated clinical data. Faster, well-supported proof-of-concept timelines reduce development risk and help sponsors build credibility with investors and partners earlier in a program&#8217;s life.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row full-width-section  top_margin_80px\" id=\"Related-posts\" style=\"padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 80px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\"><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop using-bg-color\" style=\"background-color: #f1edec;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6af646f7b7e67\" style=\"padding-bottom: 40px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">You May Also Like</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"nectar-post-grid-wrap Related-posts text-color-dark spacing-15px\"><div class=\"nectar-post-grid-filters\"><div><a class=\"active all-filter\" href=\"#\">All</a><a href=\"#\">Case Study</a></div></div><div class=\"nectar-post-grid custom_font_size_18px font_line_height_24px card_hover_color_ffffff category-position-before-title \"><div class=\"nectar-post-grid-item\" style=\"background-color: #faf7f7;\"> <div class=\"inner\"><div class=\"nectar-post-grid-item-bg-wrap\"><div class=\"nectar-post-grid-item-bg-wrap-inner\"><a class=\"bg-wrap-link\" href=\"https://www.certara.com/case-study/securing-pimicotinib-approval-how-abbisko-therapeutics-successfully-completed-its-nmpa-and-fda-submissions-with-pinnacle-21-enterprise/\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Securing Pimicotinib Approval: How Abbisko Therapeutics Successfully Completed its NMPA and FDA Submissions with Pinnacle 21 Enterprise</span></a><div class=\"nectar-post-grid-item-bg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-post-image\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://www.certara.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Abbisko.jpg\" width=\"600\" /></div></div></div><div 